The following parts originated in that repository and were adapted here:

- shared/tsdown.client.ts and shared/web-platform.ts: the client-bundle build
  preset shared by the dsh-web plugin family (vendored so this repository builds
  standalone).
- src/core/teambition/* and parts of src/host/{client,transport,http}.ts: the
  Teambition REST client, endpoint candidates, task mapping, and redaction
  helpers from the dsh-web dsh-task-board package.

The DSH plugin panel itself (src/client, src/host/{service,routes,config-store,
agent-tool}, src/core/protocol.ts, the sidebar/main slot registration, and the
workspace-execution flow) was written for this repository.
